It should keep the text of an @prompt an author already wrote
{% doc %}
  @param {string} title - the title

  @prompt
  Build me a sale sticker with a rotating symbol and a second line
{% enddoc %}

It should break a line at an embedded annotation-like @, as it does for any unmodelled tag
{% doc %}
  @prompt
  A rotating
  @ symbol
{% enddoc %}

It should not let a @prompt swallow the annotations after it
{% doc %}
  @prompt
  Build me a sale sticker

  @param {string} title - the title

  @description This is a description
{% enddoc %}
